      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The following code shows an example of creating a [`SparseMatrix_Double`](sparsematrix_double.md) structure from a BLAS opaque matrix and multiplying it by a vector:",
      "normalizedSource": "The following code shows an example of creating a [`SparseMatrix_Double`](sparsematrix_double.md) structure from a BLAS opaque matrix and multiplying it by a vector:",
      "sourceHash": "fda10668e766fd5ae17dc6fa1f5b5a6ae216b9b93d8410dc4c2b50f92ba045a1",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nguard let blasMatrix = sparse_matrix_create_float(4, 4) else {\n    return\n}\n\nsparse_insert_entry_float(blasMatrix, 1.0, 0, 0)\nsparse_insert_entry_float(blasMatrix, 4.0, 3, 0)\nsparse_insert_entry_float(blasMatrix, 13.0, 0, 3)\nsparse_insert_entry_float(blasMatrix, 16.0, 3, 3)\n\nlet A: SparseMatrix_Float = SparseConvertFromOpaque(blasMatrix)\n\ndefer {\n    SparseCleanup(A)\n}\n\n/// The values for _x_ in _y=Ax_.\nvar xValues: [Float] = [10.0, -1.0, -1.0, 10.0]\n\n/// The values for _y_ in _y=Ax_.\nlet yValues = [Float](unsafeUninitializedCapacity: xValues.count) {\n    resultBuffer, count in\n    \n    xValues.withUnsafeMutableBufferPointer { xValuesPtr in\n        /// The _x_ in _y=Ax_.\n        let x = DenseVector_Float(count: 4,\n                                  data: xValuesPtr.baseAddress!)\n        \n        /// The _y_ in _y=Ax_.\n        let y = DenseVector_Float(count: 4,\n                                  data: resultBuffer.baseAddress!)\n        \n        SparseMultiply(A, x, y)\n    }\n    \n    count = xValues.count\n}\n```",
      "documentTitle": "SparseConvertFromOpaque(:)",
      "framework": "Accelerate",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
